        "content": "<p>as noted in my comment on the issue, I don't want to automate the sorting, but if anyone wants to make a PR to make the stdlib alphabetical for now (or alphabetical with types at the top) I'm fine with that - would be an improvement over the status quo!</p>",
        "id": 632788397,
        "sender_full_name": "Richard Feldman",
        "timestamp": 1792328929
